WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:02.634
-Welcome, everybody.
Welcome, welcome, welcome,

00:00:02.634 --> 00:00:04.434
to "The Tonight Show."
You're here, you made it.

00:00:04.434 --> 00:00:06.434
Thank you for watching.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:06.434 --> 00:00:08.267
I can see everyone's
in a good mood.

00:00:08.267 --> 00:00:10.634
That's right, 'cause today
Amazon kicked off

00:00:10.634 --> 00:00:13.868
