every twice a year.

00:00:19.834 --> 00:00:21.701
That's what I say.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:21.701 --> 00:00:23.567
For Prime Day, I saw Amazon

00:00:23.567 --> 00:00:26.968
was offering discounts on
DNA test kits.

00:00:26.968 --> 00:00:29.334
