and knife sets.

00:00:47.067 --> 00:00:49.501
So it's a great day to save
if you're James Bond.

00:00:49.501 --> 00:00:52.300
[ Laughter and cheers ]

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:54.434
Guys, speaking of movies,
I heard that Tom Cruise

00:00:54.434 --> 00:00:58.400
is set to film a movie in space,
becoming the first civilian

00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:01.434
to walk outside
the International Space Station.

00:01:01.434 --> 00:01:04.501
