"Jerry Maguire 2."

00:01:04.501 --> 00:01:07.467
[ Laughter ]

00:01:07.467 --> 00:01:10.234
"Do you know the human head
weighs zero pounds in space?"

00:01:10.234 --> 00:01:11.868
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.868 --> 00:01:16.133
"Help me help the moon.
Help me to help the moon."

00:01:16.133 --> 00:01:17.868
[ Laughter ]

00:01:17.868 --> 00:01:20.200
It's a big deal. When they
heard, the Space Force was like,

00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:21.767
"Oh, come on.
We haven't even gone up yet.

00:01:21.767 --> 00:01:23.901
Come on,
this is getting insane.

00:01:23.901 --> 00:01:26.200
Let us do something."

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:28.868
Let's get to some news. Today,
President Biden and other G7

00:01:28.868 --> 00:01:31.200
