from 5,000 miles away.

00:01:39.968 --> 00:01:42.334
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.334 --> 00:01:44.300
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:44.300 --> 00:01:46.834
"Totally. We're here.
We're here for you."

00:01:49.300 --> 00:01:52.200
But Biden promised Zelenskyy
that the U.S. will continue

00:01:52.200 --> 00:01:55.167
providing Ukraine with the
support needed to defend itself.

00:01:55.167 --> 00:01:58.067
It was a strong, powerful
message, until the other leaders

00:01:58.067 --> 00:02:01.067
