Joe? Joe?

00:02:01.067 --> 00:02:02.300
You're on -- press --"

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:03.534
[ Applause ]

00:02:03.534 --> 00:02:06.901
"We can't hear. Press mute.
We can't --"

00:02:09.033 --> 00:02:11.868
Meanwhile, today, a top British
spy official said that Russia

00:02:11.868 --> 00:02:14.000
is running out of ammunition.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:16.367
That's pretty bad.
Right now their best strategy

00:02:16.367 --> 00:02:19.968
