giant fun doll, and in doll

00:02:19.968 --> 00:02:23.801
is another doll, and in that
doll is another doll,

00:02:23.801 --> 00:02:26.300
and inside that doll --
wait for it --

00:02:26.300 --> 00:02:27.801
